          q: 'Titan\'s atmosphere contains approximately 5% methane, yet UV photolysis would destroy all atmospheric methane in roughly 30 million years — far shorter than Titan\'s 4.5-billion-year age. What does this imply, what are the leading candidate sources for the missing methane, and why is none of them yet confirmed by Cassini data?',
